### GET all contacts
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts

### GET contact by id
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts/6483ce023f46080316e0c6d8

### Create contact
POST http://localhost:3000/contacts HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "fName": "John",
    "lName": "Hammond",
    "email": "test@example.com",
    "favColor": "pink",
    "bday": "1991-01-01"
  }

